<title>USA: Mississippi View to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Mississippi View to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE FALLS, Minn. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi View Holding Co said Monday it plans to repurchase up to 81,874 shares of common stock, or up to 10 percent of the 818,743 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it filed the necessary regulatory notice and received regulatory approval to initiate the repurchase program.</p>
<p>Mississippi View is the holding company of Community Federal Savings and Loan Association of Little Falls.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
